**Computation site:** `internal/markdown/markdown.go` — the `markdown.Service.ExtractAll()` method (and its single-purpose siblings `ExtractTags`/`ExtractProperties`), invoked through the helper `RebuildMemoPayload()` in `server/runner/memopayload/runner.go`. This parses the memo's raw Markdown content into a goldmark AST and walks it once to fill in `storepb.MemoPayload.Property` and `storepb.MemoPayload.Tags` (defined in `proto/store/memo.proto`).

